he end of business on the deadline date. Applications received after hours (4:30 p.m. after Labour Day; 4 p.m. after Victoria Day) will be deemed late. We thank all applicants but only those selected for an interview will be contacted. For more information Contact our office at (506) 453-4648. Employment equity The University of New Brunswick is committed to the principle of employment equity. Applicants are encouraged to complete a voluntary self-identification questionnaire, which will be provided during the application process. Learn More Resources About UNB Campus Maps Campus Security Careers at UNB Services at UNB Conference Services Libraries Online & Continuing Ed Leadership Connect with UNB Contact UNB Connect with UNB Contact UNB Resources Toggle navigation About UNB Campus Maps Campus Security Careers at UNB Services at UNB Conference Services Libraries Online & Continuing Ed Leadership © University of New Brunswick Privacy Accessibility Web feedback Close suggested results"
