Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-08-07 Application Deadline : 2026-08-21 Disposition : Instructor(s) hired View Details Course Title: Mechanics for Engineers II Course Prefix : ENGG Course Number : 1202 Lec&Tut Section : SJ02B&3B (concomitant) Term : Winter Posting Date : 2026-08-07 Application Deadline : 2026-08-21 Disposition : Instructor(s) hired View Details Course Title: Kinematics and Dynamics of Machines Course Prefix : ME Course Number : 2143 Lec&Tut Section : SJ01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-08-07 Application Deadline : 2026-08-21 Disposition : Instructor(s) hired View Details Nursing and Health Sciences, Department of Course Title: Clinical Practicum: Nursing & Wellness Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 1235 Section : SJ01B Term : Winter Posting Date : 2026-07-27 Application Deadline : 2026-08-10 Disposition : Review of applications will continue until position is filled View Details Course Title: Wolokehkitimkil – Indigenous Health and Healing Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 1333 Section : SJ01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-29 Application Deadline : 2026-07-14 Disposition : Review of applications will continue until position is filled View Details Course Title: Wolokehkitimkil - Indigenous Health and Healing Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 1333 Section : SJ02A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-29 Application Deadline : 2026-07-14 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: Clinical Practicum: Community Development I Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 3067 Section : SJ01B Term : Winter Posting Date : 2026-07-27 Application Deadline : 2026-08-17 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: Clinical Practicum: Acute Health Challenges Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 3073 Section : SJ01B Term : Winter Posting Date : 2026-07-27 Application Deadline : 2026-08-17 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: Clinical Practicum: Nurs in Complex Situation Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 4322 Section : SJ01B Term : Winter Posting Date : 2026-07-27 Application Deadline : 2026-08-17 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: Clinical Practicum: Nursing in Complex Situations Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 4322 Section : SJ01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-07-14 Application Deadline : 2026-07-28 Disposition : Review of applications will continue until position is filled View Details Moncton Fredericton - Nursing, Faculty of Nursing Course Title: AP Clinical Practicum Wellness and Chronicity Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 1136 Section : MO 01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-11 Application Deadline : 2026-06-22 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: AP Clinical Practicum Community & Population Health Nursing Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 3068 Section : MO 01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-11 Application Deadline : 2026-06-22 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: AP Clinical Practicum: Acute Health Challenges Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 3073 Section : MO 01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-11 Application Deadline : 2026-06-22 Disposition : none View Details Course Title: Clinical: Nursing Families in Complex Situations Course Prefix : NURS Course Number : 4125 Section : MO 01A Term : Fall Posting Date : 2026-06-11 Application Deadline : 2026-06-22 Disposition : none View Details Resources About UNB Campus Maps Campus Security Careers at UNB Services at UNB Conference Services Libraries Online & Continuing Ed Leadership Connect with UNB Contact UNB Connect with UNB Contact UNB Resources Toggle navigation About UNB Campus Maps Campus Security Careers at UNB Services at UNB Conference Services Libraries Online & Continuing Ed Leadership © University of New Brunswick Privacy Accessibility Web feedback Close suggested results"
